    "checks": [
      "The code has no general ADU. The only accessory unit is a Unit for Care of Relative: up to two persons, relatives of the residents of the main unit, at least one needing care for illness, old age or disability (1322.03(bbb)(2))",
      "The unit must be built to be reconverted into the main house, or be a modular cottage removed when the relative leaves. A lawful detached garage may be converted and later reconverted (1322.03(bbb)(3))",
      "A legally binding mechanism must bar use as a separate dwelling after the relative leaves, binding on future owners (1322.03(bbb)(4))",
      "Permit renews every year with a written statement that the relative still lives there (1322.03(bbb)(5))",
      "Attached unit: internal doorway to the main unit. Only one entry door facing a public street (1322.03(bbb)(8), (9))",
      "A general rental ADU has no path in the use tables. Closest options: conversion of an existing one-family dwelling into two or more units by special exception in RG and RT, only for a pre-existing detached or semi-detached building over 3,000 sq ft (1304 table, 1322.03(o)(6)). Otherwise a use variance from the Zoning Hearing Board",
      "A new second kitchen is barred unless it serves a relative who needs care because of age or disability (1302 Dwelling Unit)",
      "Bethlehem spans Northampton and Lehigh counties. Lehigh part county subdivision GEOID is 4207706088"
    ],
    "notes": "Zoning office: City of Bethlehem Zoning Office (page in source_urls). Census GEOID is the 2020 county subdivision code for the Northampton County part, from TIGERweb."
